      "text": "METROBASE Traffic Update as of 7:00pm\n\nWHEN: March 7, 2026\n\nA. MAJOR ROADS:\n\n*EDSA\nSOUTHBOUND \n- Santolan, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Shaw, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Tramo to Taft, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND\n- Park Ave. to Taft Ave., moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Shaw to Ortigas, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Whiteplains to Aurora, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- QC Academy, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Balintawak, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*C5\nSOUTHBOUND\n- UP Town Center, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- B. Serrano, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Lanuza, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- Bonny Serrano, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Aurora Katipunan to Ateneo, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles) \n- UP Town Center, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*COMMONWEALTH\nEASTBOUND:\n- Doña Carmen to FCM Regalado, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*QUEZON AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Sct. Albano, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Delta, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*MARCOS HIGHWAY\nEASTBOUND:\n- F. Mariano, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n- Sta. Lucia, moderate to slow moving (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND:\n- Light traffic\n\n*ORTIGAS AVENUE\nEASTBOUND:\n- Greenhills, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nWESTBOUND\n- EDSA, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Greenhills, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Santolan, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\n*ROXAS BOULEVARD\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- Quirino to P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n- Coastal, moderate (due to volume of vehicles)\n\nNORTHBOUND:\n- P. Burgos, moderate (due to volume of vehicles) \n\n*TAFT AVENUE\nSOUTHBOUND:\n- P. Ocampo, moderate (due to volume of